{"id":"01-ai/yi-large","name":"01.AI: Yi Large","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1719273600,"provider":"01-ai","description":"The Yi Large model was designed by 01.AI with the following usecases in mind: knowledge search, data classification, human-like chat bots, and customer service.

It stands out for its multilingual proficiency, particularly in Spanish, Chinese, Japanese, German, and French.

Check out the [launch announcement](https://01-ai.github.io/blog/01.ai-yi-large-llm-launch) to learn more.","capabilities":["text"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":32768,"input_modalities":["text"],"output_modalities":["text"]}

{"id":"amazon/nova-pro-v1","name":"Amazon: Nova Pro 1.0","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1733436303,"provider":"amazon","description":"Amazon Nova Pro 1.0 is a capable multimodal model from Amazon focused on providing a combination of accuracy, speed, and cost for a wide range of tasks. As of December 2024, it achieves state-of-the-art performance on key benchmarks including visual question answering (TextVQA) and video understanding (VATEX).

Amazon Nova Pro demonstrates strong capabilities in processing both visual and textual information and at analyzing financial documents.

**NOTE**: Video input is not supported at this time.","capabilities":["text","image"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":300000,"input_modalities":["text","image"],"output_modalities":["text"]}

{"id":"anthropic/claude-3.7-sonnet","name":"Anthropic: Claude 3.7 Sonnet","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1740422110,"provider":"anthropic","description":"Claude 3.7 Sonnet is an advanced large language model with improved reasoning, coding, and problem-solving capabilities. It introduces a hybrid reasoning approach, allowing users to choose between rapid responses and extended, step-by-step processing for complex tasks. The model demonstrates notable improvements in coding, particularly in front-end development and full-stack updates, and excels in agentic workflows, where it can autonomously navigate multi-step processes. 

Claude 3.7 Sonnet maintains performance parity with its predecessor in standard mode while offering an extended reasoning mode for enhanced accuracy in math, coding, and instruction-following tasks.

Read more at the [blog post here](https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-7-sonnet)","capabilities":["text","image"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":200000,"input_modalities":["text","image"],"output_modalities":["text"]}

{"id":"anthropic/claude-3.7-sonnet:thinking","name":"Anthropic: Claude 3.7 Sonnet (thinking)","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1740422110,"provider":"anthropic","description":"Claude 3.7 Sonnet is an advanced large language model with improved reasoning, coding, and problem-solving capabilities. It introduces a hybrid reasoning approach, allowing users to choose between rapid responses and extended, step-by-step processing for complex tasks. The model demonstrates notable improvements in coding, particularly in front-end development and full-stack updates, and excels in agentic workflows, where it can autonomously navigate multi-step processes. 

Claude 3.7 Sonnet maintains performance parity with its predecessor in standard mode while offering an extended reasoning mode for enhanced accuracy in math, coding, and instruction-following tasks.

Read more at the [blog post here](https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-7-sonnet)","capabilities":["text","image"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":200000,"input_modalities":["text","image"],"output_modalities":["text"]}

{"id":"deepseek/deepseek-r1","name":"DeepSeek: R1","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1737381095,"provider":"deepseek","description":"DeepSeek R1 is here: Performance on par with [OpenAI o1](/openai/o1), but open-sourced and with fully open reasoning tokens. It's 671B parameters in size, with 37B active in an inference pass.

Fully open-source model & [technical report](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news250120).

MIT licensed: Distill & commercialize freely!","capabilities":["text"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":128000,"input_modalities":["text"],"output_modalities":["text"]}

{"id":"openai/o1-mini","name":"OpenAI: o1-mini","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1726099200,"provider":"openai","description":"The latest and strongest model family from OpenAI, o1 is designed to spend more time thinking before responding.

The o1 models are optimized for math, science, programming, and other STEM-related tasks. They consistently exhibit PhD-level accuracy on benchmarks in physics, chemistry, and biology. Learn more in the [launch announcement](https://openai.com/o1).

Note: This model is currently experimental and not suitable for production use-cases, and may be heavily rate-limited.","capabilities":["text"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":128000,"input_modalities":["text"],"output_modalities":["text"]}

{"id":"openai/o1","name":"OpenAI: o1","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1734459999,"provider":"openai","description":"The latest and strongest model family from OpenAI, o1 is designed to spend more time thinking before responding. The o1 model series is trained with large-scale reinforcement learning to reason using chain of thought. 

The o1 models are optimized for math, science, programming, and other STEM-related tasks. They consistently exhibit PhD-level accuracy on benchmarks in physics, chemistry, and biology. Learn more in the [launch announcement](https://openai.com/o1).
","capabilities":["text","image"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":200000,"input_modalities":["text","image"],"output_modalities":["text"]}

{"id":"meta-llama/llama-3.1-405b","name":"Meta: Llama 3.1 405B (base)","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1722556800,"provider":"meta-llama","description":"Meta's latest class of model (Llama 3.1) launched with a variety of sizes & flavors. This is the base 405B pre-trained version.

It has demonstrated strong performance compared to leading closed-source models in human evaluations.

To read more about the model release, [click here](https://ai.meta.com/blog/meta-llama-3/). Usage of this model is subject to [Meta's Acceptable Use Policy](https://llama.meta.com/llama3/use-policy/).","capabilities":["text"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":32768,"input_modalities":["text"],"output_modalities":["text"]}

{"id":"deepseek/deepseek-v3-base","name":"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V3 Base","rank":0,"isNew":false,"created":1743272023,"provider":"deepseek","description":"Note that this is a base model mostly meant for testing, you need to provide detailed prompts for the model to return useful responses. 

DeepSeek-V3 Base is a 671B parameter open Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) language model with 37B active parameters per forward pass and a context length of 128K tokens. Trained on 14.8T tokens using FP8 mixed precision, it achieves high training efficiency and stability, with strong performance across language, reasoning, math, and coding tasks. 

DeepSeek-V3 Base is the pre-trained model behind [DeepSeek V3](/deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3)","capabilities":["text"],"tokens_served":0,"context_length":163840,"input_modalities":["text"],"output_modalities":["text"]}
